In article <RN.3185@mts.ucs.UAlberta.CA> userRH38@mts.ucs.UAlberta.CA (Chris Dubelaar) writes:
>I had TWO AofY.  I knew one of them was
>real as I was getting clarivoyance, so off I trundled to find the
>stair up.

You would probably want to determine which of the two is the real
amulet (using Ye Olde put it in the bag trick) before proceeding, and
#name it "real", so that you will know if the Wiz steals a real or
fake one right away.

>When I found it, the wiz attacked me with a few pets, one
>of which was White dragon which shattered my potion of paralysis.

Should always keep a spare. I try to have at least 3 or 4. Or else
keep it in a bag until you are ready to throw it at him.

>Stupid move. I am now above the castle
>and am trying to figure out how to get back down into hell.  All
>the level teleporters have disappeared and there are no scrolls of
>teleport so I can't figure out how to get back down.

Lots of things you can do. Polymorph scrolls until you get a teleport
one. Use a wish from your old WOW or try to get one from a fountain or
throne to get what you need. Look in any isolated 1x1 squares on the
normal levels for the teleport scrolls. Just kill a bunch of monsters
until you get some more scrolls...

>Another unusual thing that I have run into is that random items
>in my pack are getting cursed and uncursed at various times.
>What causes this?  I
>Thought that this would only happen if you had the AofY, but
>evidently not.

It's still the AOY that causes the periodic cursing. However, once you
pick up the Amulet, this will happen periodically forever until your
game ends, even if you drop the Amulet or leave it on another level. I
think it's based on the u.demigod flag in the code but I'm not an
expert on this. IMHO it's really annoying.

>Is there anything I can do to prevent this?
>My gray drag. scale mail has no effect at all.

Nothing we can do, except I try to ascend as quickly as possible after
killing the wizard so I don't have to deal with it as long.

Suggested new item: A ring (or amulet) of curse resistance. While
wearing this, it will prevent any of your items from being cursed by
magic using monsters, such as liches, nagas, titans, shamans, demon
lords, and of course the Wiz. Perhaps it could be set up so that
nothing in your inventory can change its blessed/curse status while
you are wearing, so you would have to remove it before you can get any
effects from remove curse or holy water.

